<title>USA: CME average feeder steer price.</title>
<headline>CME average feeder steer price.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Chicago Mercantile Exchange reported the average feeder steer price for the seven calendar days ending Tuesday, Nov 12 used for cash settlement of CME Feeder Cattle contracts. (in dollars per cwt) --</p>
<p>12-STATES - FOR 7 DAYS ENDING -</p>
<p>Tuesday	Nov	 12   $64.43    up 0.01</p>
<p>Monday	 Nov	 11   $64.42    up 0.41</p>
</text>
